      "instance_name": "ice_cubes_float_concept",
      "label": "Physical property of ice",
      "description": "The concept that ice cubes float in water is a basic physical principle rooted in the anomalous expansion of water. This scientific fact is used in the meme to create a false equivalence with the idea of an 'unnecessary life vest'. Understanding this scientific fact is essential to grasp the absurdity of the analogy.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
