      "instance_name": "T_I_Thornton_identity",
      "label": "Identity of Anthony T.I. Thornton",
      "description": "Anthony T.I. Thornton is a well-known Black American rapper and actor. His public persona, often associated with caution, preparedness, and a certain 'over-the-top' style, is the target of the meme's humor. Understanding his identity and public image is necessary to interpret the meme's intent to mock his perceived behavior.",
