      "instance_name": "unnecessary_life_vest_mapping",
      "label": "T.I. is mapped as an unnecessary life-vest",
      "description": "The top text 'unnecessary life-vest' is mapped onto Anthony T.I. Thornton, implying that he is being portrayed as an unnecessary safety device, due to the false equivalence with 'ice cubes float'. This mapping uses the visual presence of the person as the subject of the joke, projecting the textual concept of an 'unnecessary life-vest' onto him.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
