    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_9773378e",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience for this meme is individuals familiar with Anthony T.I. Thornton's public persona and media presence, particularly those who recognize his image and understand the cultural context of his 'over-the-top' or cautious behavior. The meme relies on the audience's awareness of his identity and reputation to derive humor from the false equivalence. The audience is likely composed of fans of hip-hop culture, internet meme enthusiasts, and people who engage with pop culture commentary, as the joke is rooted in a specific cultural reference to T.I.'s persona. The humor is accessible to those who understand the absurdity of the analogy and the stereotype of overpreparedness, which is often used in internet humor to mock perceived excess or caution in public figures.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
